---
import Arrow from "./Arrow.astro";
import Layout from "./Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="jwstn.dev — a personal zine from Cologne"
  description="Full-stack developer in Cologne, building web apps with TanStack, playing with Effect, and taking cameras on trips."
>
  <article class="riso-cover">
    <p class="riso-kicker riso-rise">
      a personal zine · <span class="riso-kicker-ink">two inks, one pass</span> · read in any order
    </p>

    <h1 class="riso-cover-title riso-rise d1">
      Hey! I'm JW.
      <small>I build web things.</small>
    </h1>

    <div class="riso-rise d2">
      <span class="riso-stamp riso-stamp-solid riso-stamp-in">printed in cologne ↺</span>
    </div>

    <p class="riso-cover-bio riso-rise d2">
      Full-stack developer from Cologne, Germany. Day to day I'm deep in
      <a href="https://tanstack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TanStack</a> — it hands
      you most of what a web app needs, server actions and middleware included, so I still haven't found
      my excuse to take backend frameworks like
      <a href="https://hono.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hono</a> or
      <a href="https://elysiajs.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Elysia</a> for a proper
      spin. The backend rabbit hole I <em>did</em> fall down is
      <a href="https://effect.website/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Effect</a> — amazing
      fun so far, and a genuinely new way to think about programs.
    </p>

    <section class="riso-toc riso-rise d3" aria-labelledby="riso-toc-heading">
      <h2 id="riso-toc-heading">in this issue ↓</h2>
      <ul class="riso-toc-list">
        <li>
          <a href="/projects">
            <span class="riso-toc-no">№01</span>
            <span class="riso-toc-title">Projects</span>
            <span class="riso-toc-note">four build stories, zero lorem ipsum</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/blog">
            <span class="riso-toc-no">№02</span>
            <span class="riso-toc-title">Blog</span>
            <span class="riso-toc-note ink">
              blank page — the ink is still wet, check back
              <Arrow />
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/gallery">
            <span class="riso-toc-no">№03</span>
            <span class="riso-toc-title">Gallery</span>
            <span class="riso-toc-note">photos from cologne &amp; beyond, printed in two inks</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p class="riso-hand">
      psst — japan 2026: camera loaded, film chosen.
      <Arrow class="blue" />
      the prints land in <a href="/gallery" class="riso-index-read">the gallery</a> as soon as they're
      developed.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
